@startuml Video_Sync_Flow

title Video Sync Flow - RSS Polling & Real-time Updates

skinparam backgroundColor #0f0f0f
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #cc0000
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #181818
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #272727
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #404040

participant "Cron Job\n(Every 5 min)" as Cron
participant "poll-rss-feeds\nEdge Function" as RSS
participant "YouTube\nRSS Feed" as YT
database "tracked_videos" as TV
database "user_videos" as UV
participant "Realtime\nSubscription" as RT
participant "User Browser" as User

== RSS Polling (Every 5 minutes) ==
Cron -> RSS: Trigger poll
RSS -> RSS: Get channels to poll\n(get_channels_for_rss_poll)
loop For each channel
  RSS -> YT: Fetch RSS feed
  YT --> RSS: Video entries
  RSS -> TV: Insert new videos
  note right: Only insert if\nvideo_id not exists
  TV -> TV: Trigger:\nauto_sync_video_to_users
  TV -> UV: Insert for users\nactive in 72h
  UV --> RT: Broadcast INSERT event
  RT --> User: Real-time notification
  User -> User: Refresh video list\n& show toast
end

== User Opens Ideation (After being inactive) ==
User -> UV: Call sync_missed_videos_for_user
UV -> TV: Get videos from last 7 days
UV -> UV: Insert missed videos
UV --> User: Return count of synced videos
User -> User: Show toast:\n"X videos synced"

@enduml

@startuml Admin_Approval_Flow

title Admin User Approval Flow

skinparam backgroundColor #0f0f0f
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #181818
skinparam stateBorderColor #272727
skinparam stateFontColor #f1f1f1
skinparam ArrowColor #cc0000

[*] --> Signup : User creates account

state Signup {
  [*] --> CreatingProfile
  CreatingProfile : Insert into profiles table
  CreatingProfile : status = 'pending'
  CreatingProfile --> [*]
}

Signup --> Pending

state Pending {
  [*] --> WaitingForAdmin
  WaitingForAdmin : User sees "Pending Approval" page
  WaitingForAdmin : Cannot access any features
  WaitingForAdmin --> [*]
}

Pending --> Approved : Admin clicks "Approve"
Pending --> Blocked : Admin clicks "Block"

state Approved {
  [*] --> ActiveUser
  ActiveUser : Full access to all features
  ActiveUser : Can use ideation
  ActiveUser : Can add channels
  ActiveUser : Can use AI tools
  ActiveUser --> [*]
}

state Blocked {
  [*] --> BlockedUser
  BlockedUser : User sees "Blocked" page
  BlockedUser : Can only sign out
  BlockedUser : Can contact admin
  BlockedUser --> [*]
}

Approved --> Blocked : Admin blocks user
Blocked --> Approved : Admin unblocks user

Approved --> Deleted : Admin deletes user
Pending --> Deleted : Admin deletes user
Blocked --> Deleted : Admin deletes user

state Deleted {
  [*] --> RemovedFromSystem
  RemovedFromSystem : User data deleted
  RemovedFromSystem : Videos removed
  RemovedFromSystem --> [*]
}

Deleted --> [*]

@enduml
